        <mxCell id="f1" value="1. Ler o desenho técnico (diâmetros internos, alturas a partir do apoio)." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#9a3412;align=left;spacingLeft=8;fontFamily=Times New Roman;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1056" y="132" width="488" height="48" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="f2" value="2. Preencher o núcleo: altura total, diâmetro da borda, maior diâmetro da peça, altura até o maior diâmetro, diâmetro da base." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#9a3412;align=left;spacingLeft=8;fontFamily=Times New Roman;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1056" y="190" width="488" height="56" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="f3" value="3. Opcional: medições extras (1/4, 1/2, 3/4 da altura), junção bojo–pescoço, carena." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#9a3412;align=left;spacingLeft=8;fontFamily=Times New Roman;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1056" y="256" width="488" height="52" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="f4" value="4. O programa monta o meridiano e sugere a forma; calcula volume, tamanho e centro de massa." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#9a3412;align=left;spacingLeft=8;fontFamily=Times New Roman;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1056" y="318" width="488" height="52" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="f5" value="5. Confirmar ou corrigir a forma. Gravar (SQLite)." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#9a3412;align=left;spacingLeft=8;fontFamily=Times New Roman;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1056" y="380" width="488" height="48" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="f6" value="6. Ver o perfil 2D e o sólido 3D; exportar PNG/PDF." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#9a3412;align=left;spacingLeft=8;fontFamily=Times New Roman;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1056" y="438" width="488" height="48" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
